"raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "middle", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5063845072", "display_name": "李月坤", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "李月坤", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5024224488", "display_name": "宋小燕", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "宋小燕", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"为了更好地保障职务发明人的利益，《职务发明条例草案》（送审稿）欲寻求一条用人单位与发明人利益平衡的和谐发展之路。草案（送审稿）以进一步明确职务发明的界定为突破口，在遵循现行法律法规和有关司法解释的立法精神基础上进行了一些创新，如允许“主要利用本单位物质技术条件”完成的发明在归属方面存在例外，增加了发明报告制度及处理职务发明的不同方式等。在此基础上，进一步建议将“约定优先”适用于所有的职务发明，同时明确规定禁止事先约定非职务发明的归属；建议职务发明报告制度的设计要符合我国具体情况；建议完善与单位对职务发明处理方式相适应的奖励报酬制度。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2269966677", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/83777X/201404/662095077.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S2764553319", "display_name": "Dianzi Ke-Ji Daxue xuebao. She-ke ban", "issn_l": "1008-8105", "issn": ["1008-8105"], "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": "https://openalex.org/P4310311921", "host_organization_name": "University of Electronic Science and Technology of China", "host_organization_lineage": ["https://openalex.org/P4310311921"], "host_organization_lineage_names": ["University of Electronic Science and Technology of China"], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "电子科技大学学报：社会科学版", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W219574500", "doi": null, "title": "中国版“拜杜法案”的失灵与高校知识产权转化的出路", "publication_date": "2013-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5078404359", "display_name": "何炼红", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "何炼红", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5090322688", "display_name": "陈吉灿", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "陈吉灿", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"我国《科技进步法》借鉴了美国《拜杜法案》的先进经验，明确了财政资助科技项目所形成的知识产权归属，以促进高校知识产权的转化。然而，从实施五年来的情况来看，中国版的“拜杜法案”并没有发挥其特有的作用，根本症结在于我国缺乏相应的制度运行环境。促进高校知识产权转化的关键在于推进高校法人化改革使其拥有充分的自主权，以发明人为主体完善职务发明的权属界定和权利行使规则。在现阶段，高校知识产权在转化过程中不受有形国有资产监管体制的限制，开辟绿色通道予以单独管理，也是可以采取的一个较为合理的措施。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:219574500", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/96792A/201303/45101448.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306555587", "display_name": "知识产权", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "知识产权", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W4408769261", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.70693/rwsk.v1i2.668", "title": "浅析宁夏知识产权转化运用促高质量发展的问题及对策", "publication_date": "2025-03-23", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5116767389", "display_name": "唐璐琪", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [{"id": "https://openalex.org/I3019309368", "display_name": "North Minzu University", "ror": "https://ror.org/05xjevr11", "country_code": "CN", "type": "education", "lineage": ["https://openalex.org/I3019309368"]}], "countries": ["CN"], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "唐璐琪", "raw_affiliation_strings": ["北方民族大学"], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": [{"raw_affiliation_string": "北方民族大学", "institution_ids": ["https://openalex.org/I3019309368"]}]}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"《“十四五”国家知识产权保护和运用规划》和《知识产权强国建设纲要（2021—2035年）》的出台，充分体现了国家在战略层面对知识产权的重视。知识产权创造性转化与应用是激发科技创新的的重要途径。宁夏地区作为西部地区的发展强省，一直以来对知识产权的转化运用十分重视。但是由于近些年知识产权领域的快速发展，在创造性转化促高质量发展的过程中，从不同方面出现了多种类型的问题。本文通过分析在校学生知识产权意识、职务发明过程中权利归属、高校智力成果转化、企业高新认定、个人维权以及宁夏地区非遗保护方面的问题，从不同领域、多个角度归纳问题产生的原因。根据具体的问题，结合相关领域问题的产生原因，给出相对应的解决方案，给宁夏地区的知识产权创造性转发运用提供一些切实可行建议。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "doi:10.70693/rwsk.v1i2.668", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.70693/rwsk.v1i2.668", "is_oa": true, "landing_page_url": "https://doi.org/10.70693/rwsk.v1i2.668", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S5407049355", "display_name": "人文与社会科学学刊", "issn_l": "3079-4552", "issn": ["3079-4552", "3079-4560"], "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": "cc-by", "license_id": "https://openalex.org/licenses/cc-by", "version": "publishedVersion", "is_accepted": true, "is_published": true, "raw_source_name": "人文与社会科学学刊", "raw_type": "journal-article"}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W2239260157", "doi": null, "title": "贯彻落实《条例》，全面推进不动产统一登记工作", "publication_date": "2015-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5001967311", "display_name": "胡存智", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "胡存智", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstra